 p=pages[P+'build-planner/'];c=cite(p);controls=controls.replace('</section>','<p>Mode checks use the original .75 configuration and release history: current co-op requires an account, Daily Mutation is solo without a pre-run Bag, and the team/solo milestone rules differ. They do not validate a real session.</p>'+c+'</section>',1)
