 changes=[['.75','Only pokebonk.com is the original project’s official website.','Use the original host for your existing game progress; this guide is independent.'],['.74','Inactive public leaders transfer after 90 seconds; an idle solo search cancels after three minutes.','Watch Still there? and the crown rather than assuming the lobby is broken.'],['.73','Public matchmaking, a signal wheel and registered-account co-op.','Select room conditions; a Guest is not sufficient for current co-op.'],['.73','Upgrade-choice protection gives five seconds per level, capped at ten; it does not refill itself.','Do not treat the upgrade picker as unlimited invulnerability.'],['.72','Team Survival Bill’s Machine becomes available again eleven minutes after use.','Track elapsed time since use, then inspect the real machine.'],['.72','Long-run Save & quit and event-camera fixes; big map becomes bindable, default R3.','Recheck controls rather than using the older L3-release / Select-map advice.'],['.69','The ten-second wait between Ultimates was removed.','Inspect the actual gauge; an older fixed ten-second rule is superseded.']]
