 p=pages[P+'privacy/'];p['html']=p['html'].replace('</article>','<h2>Unified declared drafts</h2><p>Support types, a separate shiny, mode/difficulty, declared Guest/Bag intentions and HP/armor/buff experiments can be included in a planning URL and the existing optional draft backup. The existing pb-build-drafts-v1 key is reused. Selecting a saved draft in move lookup reads that local list; the resulting URL is a copy, not an automatic overwrite. Returning from the support tool carries only planning declarations. No game login, account save or remote storage is read.</p></article>',1)
